72	/**
73	 * Whether the current user can actually run a Claude-powered build right now —
74	 * their own key OR a platform fallback key. Mirrors the exact gate
75	 * `submitBuild` (lib/actions-claude.ts) enforces, so any UI using this to
76	 * enable/disable a "Build with AI" control never promises more than the
77	 * server will actually allow.
