18	 *   GET  /api/files/[serverId]?path=/abs/file&download=1   -> streams the file
19	 *   POST /api/files/[serverId]?path=/abs/dir               -> multipart upload
20	 *
21	 * Both are authenticated and ownership-checked (owner or admin), path-validated
22	 * (absolute, no `..`), size-capped, and rate-limited. Real SFTP in production;
23	 * an in-memory simulation on the sandbox (handled inside lib/sftp).
